<description>&lt;p&gt;Drone strikes in the disputed Abyei border region have killed dozens of civilians, with Sudanese forces blaming the RSF for the attacks. Communal clashes linked to cattle rustling in South Sudan have left at least ten people dead, while a violent incident at Akol Koor’s residence resulted in a lawsuit before the judiciary. Two prisoners of war are scheduled to return home from Akobo, and the governor has urged General John Kenyi Latio to end fighting in Wonduruba. The United Nations recorded two battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE1Zc0dVWGU2SlJTeDhZYk12X1ZGWGpGVzJVYVFEckpRMjk4clY0SDZobE4zLU5oMzhoQXRXSWFUX2xyLVVfRFlyVGFVb2ctTVdmWHY3aE4wVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNTkZja2JVNUJZenJ5Wlg3cEVkWVkzQkZvSmN5WmVoOXUwVG5kbW0zcExRdHIwYm5NWDJhNDlOcXpnWGpxZm5RbDJrU2hxTFVRVzJCZGVnYW1MVVFDU0tmZHB6S2tRWFNObWZSa0tQNnphSjJseWM4X3BrSDR0b0F6Vlp4OVU1aUJBNXVZaG1uZzZnWDY4d3VqNl9NbTUzeUxraUktMkNxbDVibTd0bTJ6cnVR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxQUS1DMUNhTnk4SVljLWhZQnZJMlhCd0RNYnE4SkVGN1ZTY3hnc2J1S3A4OXhUQlBsakM2SnRDY2RzQlpXRlhyTFN4RjFoZk5nMmdCYklKSF9pTlBCT0NBdkYtZ0xYZVNOT1FlZGpXVnBrUTA0M0JCTkV1eHpnencwYUNIVDdYNDg4cm13N0FhV05oMmxTcklKb2hGT2xpbTJ0TjB3RUJqblRDQW04MmxMYmVzRVZKSGg5enVn?oc=5&quot;&gt;streamlinefeed.co.ke&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTFBMeUpzRjhmaTFnempZX0RSYTNPWl9wUVJITWlkTlhFQm11WjJjYWkxSmFrTVJNQUVvRVh4WFdXb2VVelRYQTA5cUVINUtOREV6UFRjeTNldDFxdHp5WEhVMDVlbk0?oc=5&quot;&gt;TRT Afrika&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=